  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support the Government of Azerbaijan in development of export strategy and support in its implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;establishing an effective system for coordinating, tracking and reporting on the implementation of national export policies and strategies&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;enhancing the service delivery capacity of AzPromo and aligning its strategic goals with the best practices of global trade promotion organizations&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;international alignment of Azerbaijan quality infrastructure system, which is fundamental for global recognition of quality and acceptance of export products.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
